    category: "Linux",
    title: "Meta 開發的 Drgn 偵錯器 0.3 版本發布，強化程式可編程性與 Linux 核心支援",
    summary: "Drgn 是 Meta 開發的開源偵錯器專案，旨在提供一個高度可編程的除錯環境，讓除錯過程更接近編碼體驗。最新發布的 Drgn 0.3 版本帶來多項重大改進。該版本持續由 Linux 核心開發者 Omar Sandoval 領先開發，主要強化了程式碼庫的安全性，特別是針對不可信的除錯資訊和核心轉儲（core dumps）進行了加固。技術上，Drgn 0.3 優化了 QEMU 客體機虛擬機的除錯功能，使其能盡可能直接從 QEMU 流程讀取記憶體。此外，它新增了多個除錯輔助功能，例如輕鬆讀取系統的 IRQ 數量、新的 crash BPF 指令選項，以及對 Linux 7.2 和 Linux 7.3 核心功能的支援。同時，Drgn 0.3 也正式支援 LoongArch64 架構，並包含大量修復與文件改進，提升了其在 Linux 系統上的除錯能力。",
    tags: ["Meta", "Drgn", "Linux 核心", "QEMU", "除錯器", "LoongArch64"],
    title_en: "Meta's Drgn Debugger 0.3 Released, Enhancing Programmability and Linux Kernel Support",
    summary_en: "Drgn is an open-source debugger project developed by Meta, designed to provide a highly programmable debugging environment that makes the debugging process feel closer to the coding experience. The newly released Drgn 0.3 version brings several major improvements. The version continues to be led in development by Linux kernel developer Omar Sandoval, primarily strengthening the codebase's security, especially regarding untrusted debug information and core dumps. Technically, Drgn 0.3 optimizes the debugging functionality for QEMU guest virtual machines, allowing it to read memory as directly as possible from the QEMU process. Furthermore, it adds multiple debugging utilities, such as easy reading of the system's IRQ count, new crash BPF options, and support for Linux 7.2 and Linux 7.3 kernel features. Concurrently, Drgn 0.3 also officially supports the LoongArch64 architecture and includes numerous fixes and documentation improvements, enhancing its debugging capabilities on Linux systems.",
