    title: "iVerify揭露P7 DarkSword iOS漏洞利用工具：新增錢包竊取與雙向C2通訊",
    summary: "資安研究機構 iVerify 公布了新型的 DarkSword iOS 漏洞利用工具變種 P7 DarkSword 的詳細資訊。該工具旨在利用多個 iOS 漏洞鏈，逃離瀏覽器沙盒，提升至核心權限，並將主負載注入 SpringBoard 系統進程。P7 DarkSword 相較於先前版本，減少了設備上的足跡，新增了對 on-device keychain 和加密錢包的竊取功能，並增加了與攻擊者基礎設施的雙向 C2 通訊能力。該工具能夠執行系統指令（如 ls, cat, whoami）、下載檔案、掃描應用程式資料（包括 Apple Notes、照片和加密錢包）、以及傳輸設備元數據。研究指出，該漏洞利用工具已被用於攻擊沙烏地阿拉伯、土耳其、馬來西亞和烏克蘭等地區。P7 DarkSword 的最新版本具備每 15 秒輪詢一次心跳訊號，並可執行多種惡意指令，包括 `wallet_extract` 和 `memo_scan` 等，顯示其極高的威脅性。建議用戶保持警惕，並關注 Apple 官方的修補通知。",
    tags: ["DarkSword", "P7 DarkSword", "iOS 漏洞", "iVerify", "C2 通訊", "資安漏洞利用"],
    title_en: "iVerify Reveals P7 DarkSword iOS Exploit Tool: Adds Wallet Theft and Bi-directional C2 Communication",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity research organization iVerify has published detailed information on a new variant of the DarkSword iOS exploit tool, named P7 DarkSword. This tool is designed to exploit multiple iOS vulnerabilities in a chain, escape the browser sandbox, elevate privileges to the core level, and inject the main payload into the SpringBoard system process. Compared to previous versions, P7 DarkSword reduces its footprint on the device, adds functionality for stealing on-device keychain and encrypted wallet data, and enhances bi-directional C2 communication with the attacker's infrastructure. The tool can execute system commands (such as ls, cat, whoami), download files, scan application data (including Apple Notes, photos, and encrypted wallets), and transmit device metadata. Research indicates that this exploit tool has been used against regions including Saudi Arabia, Turkey, Malaysia, and Ukraine. The latest version of P7 DarkSword features a heartbeat signal polling every 15 seconds and can execute various malicious commands, including `wallet_extract` and `memo_scan`, demonstrating its extremely high threat level. Users are advised to remain vigilant and monitor official Apple patch notifications.",
    tags_en: ["DarkSword", "P7 DarkSword", "iOS Vulnerability", "iVerify", "C2 Communication", "Cybersecurity Exploitation"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Hacker News", url: "https://thehackernews.com/2026/10/p7-darksword-ios-exploit-kit-adds.html", lang: "EN" }
    ]
