    title: "Emacs CVE-2026-79992 修補不完整：TRAMP 變更正規表達式以防範用戶名注入",
    summary: "資安研究人員 Wonyoung Jung 利用 PatchHawk 工具發現，Emacs 針對 CVE-2026-79992 的修補措施存在缺陷。原修補未能檢查用戶名中一些額外的問題字元，導致攻擊者仍有可能進行利用。TRAMP 維護者 Michael Albinus 發布了補丁，修復了 `tramp-user-regexp` 的正規表達式。新的正規表達式在排除先前字元清單的基礎上，額外增加了對控制字元（control）的檢查，顯著提高了用戶名驗證的安全性。該補丁預計將包含在 Emacs 31.2 版本中，但尚未發布。開發者建議用戶應關注官方發布的更新，以確保修補的完整性。",
    tags: ["Emacs", "CVE-2026-79992", "TRAMP", "正規表達式", "用戶名注入"],
    title_en: "Emacs CVE-2026-79992 Patch Incomplete: TRAMP Modifies Regex to Prevent Username Injection",
    summary_en: "Security researcher Wonyoung Jung used the PatchHawk tool to discover that the patch for CVE-2026-79992 in Emacs was flawed. The original patch failed to check for certain problematic characters in usernames, potentially allowing attackers to exploit the vulnerability. TRAMP maintainer Michael Albinus released a patch that fixed the regular expression for `tramp-user-regexp`. The new regular expression, building upon the exclusion of previous characters, additionally checks for control characters, significantly enhancing the security of username validation. This patch is expected to be included in Emacs 31.2, but has not yet been released. Developers advise users to monitor official releases to ensure the completeness of the fix.",
